==Battleground==
*6 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 6~20 seconds<sup>180f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Take along [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] and [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floatings]] if you need. Meatshield well to protect your attackers and win.

